    Bug 1998105 - Add a faster way to get message headers and expose messages.getHeaders(). r=tobyp


    Adds a shortcut to extract just the headers of a message. We still read the message,
    but stop streaming as soon as we have seen the empty line between the RFC822 header and
    body sections.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D271202

